{"id":29545,"slug":"police-story-2","title":"Police Story 2","year":1988,"country":"Hong Kong","duration":122,"spine":972,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/29545-police-story-2","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/15163b7a4904d335fa747103716ac6b6/xzkfrywuWvw3fGT9upQUmnwHtRIjsE_large.jpg","description":"Jackie Chan followed up the massive success of Police Story with an even bigger box-office hit. Having been demoted to a lowly traffic cop for his, ahem, unorthodox policing methods, Chan’s go-it-alone officer Ka-Kui quits the force in protest. But it isn’t long before he’s back in action, racing the clock to stop a band of serial bombers and win back his much-put-upon girlfriend May (the phenomenal Maggie Cheung, reprising her star-making role). Boasting epic explosions, an awesomely 1980s electro soundtrack, and a showstopping finale—which turns an abandoned warehouse into a life-size pinball machine of cascading oil drums, collapsing scaffolds, and shooting fireworks—Police Story 2 confirmed Chan’s status as a performer of unparalleled grace and daring.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Jackie Chan","slug":"jackie-chan"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Jackie Chan","role":"Chan Ka-kui","slug":"jackie-chan"},{"actor":"Maggie Cheung","role":"May","slug":"maggie-cheung"},{"actor":"Bill Tung","role":"Bill","slug":"bill-tung"},{"actor":"Lam Kwok-Hung","role":"Division Inspector Raymond Lam","slug":"lam-kwok-hung"},{"actor":"Crystal Kwok, Anglie Leung Wan-Yui, Ann Mui, Candice Tai","role":"Police interrogators","slug":"crystal-kwok-anglie-leung-wan-yui-ann-mui-candice-tai"},{"actor":"Chor Yuen","role":"Chu","slug":"chor-yuen"},{"actor":"Kenny Ho","role":"Policeman PC12674","slug":"kenny-ho"},{"actor":"John Cheung","role":"Polar bear","slug":"john-cheung"},{"actor":"Charlie Cho","role":"John Ko","slug":"charlie-cho"},{"actor":"Andy Tai Chi-Wai","role":"Crazy Fai","slug":"andy-tai-chi-wai"},{"actor":"Ng Sing-Fat","role":"Sergeant Ng","slug":"ng